ues":"5 / 15 / 25 / 35 / 45"}]}},"E:灿丽花火":{"slot":"E","skill":{"id":"ZeriE","name":"灿丽花火","description":"泽丽冲刺一小段距离，并激发【电火迸射】，使其获得穿刺敌人的效果。她将在接触任何地形时进行翻越和滑行。","maxrank":5,"cooldown":[24,22.5,21,19.5,18],"cost":[90,85,80,75,70],"image":{"full":"ZeriE.png","sprite":"spell17.png","group":"spell","x":384,"y":0,"w":48,"h":48},"cooldownBurn":"24/22.5/21/19.5/18","costBurn":"90/85/80/75/70","costType":"法力","rankValues":[]}},"P:内能迁转":{"slot":"P","passive":{"name":"内能迁转","description":"泽丽的攻击造成魔法伤害并被视为技能。移动和施放【电火迸射】会将能量储存至泽丽的【火花背包】。在完全充能后，她的下次攻击将造成额外伤害。","image":{"full":"ZeriP.png","sprite":"passive5.png","group":"passive","x":336,"y":48,"w":48,"h":48},"rankValues":[]}},"W:强穿激光":{"slot":"W","skill":{"id":"ZeriW","name":"强穿激光","description":"泽丽发射一道电能脉冲，来对首个命中的敌人造成减速和伤害。如果脉冲命中了一个墙体，那么它会延伸为一道长程激光。","maxrank":5,"cooldown":[12,11,10,9,8],"cost":[50,60,70,80,90],"image":{"full":"ZeriW.png","sprite":"spell17.png","group":"spell","x":336,"y":0,"w":48,"h":48},"cooldownBurn":"12/11/10/9/8","costBurn":"50/60/70/80/90","costType":"法力","rankValues":[{"label":"减速持续时间","values":"2秒"}]}},"R:超限爆闪":{"slot":"R","skill":{"id":"ZeriR","name":"超限爆闪","description":"泽丽放出一道电能新星，并且自身进入超负荷状态，来获得伤害提升和可叠加的移动速度，并且这个状态可在她每次命中敌方英雄时刷新持续时间并变得更强。在超负荷状态下。【枪火迸射】会变成一个快速的3连发，并在敌人之间引发连锁闪电。","maxrank":3,"cooldown":[80,75,70],"cost":[100,100,100],"image":{"full":"ZeriR.png","sprite":"spell17.png","group":"spell","x":432,"y":0,"w":48,"h":48},"cooldownBurn":"80/75/70","costBurn":"100/100/100","costType":"法力","rankValues":[]}}},"Zoe":{"E:催眠气泡":{"slot":"E","skill":{"id":"ZoeE","name":"催眠气泡","description":"困倦使目标进入困倦状态，然后陷入昏睡。在昏睡状态下，目标的魔抗会被降低。打醒目标的第一个伤害来源会造成双倍伤害，但有封顶值。","maxrank":5,"cooldown":[18,17,16,15,14],"cost":[80,80,80,80,80],"image":{"full":"ZoeE.png","sprite":"spell17.png","group":"spell","x":0,"y":96,"w":48,"h":48},"cooldownBurn":"18/17/16/15/14","costBurn":"80/80/80/80/80","costType":"法力","rankValues":[{"label":"基础伤害","values":"70 / 110 / 150 / 190 / 230"}]},"icons":[{"file":"patch-notes/icons/a6717b379a71ca21a0adbf78565f8e45.webp","spellId":"ZoeE"}]},"W:窃法巧手":{"slot":"W","skill":{"id":"ZoeW","name":"窃法巧手","description":"佐伊可以拾取敌方在施放召唤师技能和主动型装备时产生的法术碎片，从而让她自己能够施放一次性的相应技能或效果。在她施放一次召唤师技能的同时，她会获得3颗飞弹来射向距她最近的目标。","maxrank":5,"cooldown":[0.25],"cost":[0,0,0,0,0],"image":{"full":"ZoeW.png","sprite":"spell17.png","group":"spell","x":432,"y":48,"w":48,"h":48},"cooldownBurn":"0.25","costBurn":"0/0/0/0/0","costType":"法力","rankValues":[]}}},"Ambessa":{"R:公开处刑":{"slot":"R","skill":{"id":"AmbessaR","name":"公开处刑","description":"安蓓萨选择一条直线，然后瞬移到直线上相距最远的那个敌方英雄身旁，并在到达后压制该英雄。随后将目标砸向地面，对其造成伤害和晕眩。","maxrank":3,"cooldown":[130,115,100],"cost":[0,0,0],"image":{"full":"AmbessaR.png","sprite":"spell1.png","group":"spell","x":48,"y":0,"w":48,"h":48},"cooldownBurn":"130/115/100","costBurn":"0/0/0","costType":"能量","rankValues":[]}}},"Briar":{},"Ezreal":{"Q:秘术射击":{"slot":"Q","skill":{"id":"EzrealQ","name":"秘术射击","description":"伊泽瑞尔发射一枚能量弹，如果它击中一个敌方单位，那么它将略微减少伊泽瑞尔所有技能的冷却时间。","maxrank":5,"cooldown":[5.5,5.25,5,4.75,4.5],"cost":[28,31,34,37,40],"image":{"full":"EzrealQ.png","sprite":"spell3.png","group":"spell","x":288,"y":96,"w":48,"h":48},"cooldownBurn":"5.5/5.25/5/4.75/4.5","costBurn":"28/31/34/37/40","costType":"法力","rankValues":[{"label":"基础伤害","values":"20 / 45 / 70 / 95 / 120"}]},"icons":[{"file":"patch-notes/icons/4564965b9799bba407a0b03203c475eb.webp","spellId":"EzrealQ"}]},"W:精华跃动":{"slot":"W","skill":{"id":"EzrealW","name":"精华跃动","description":"伊泽瑞尔发射一个法球，法球会附着在命中的第一个敌方英雄或战略点上。如果伊泽瑞尔用技能或攻击命中一个法球时，会将它引爆来造成伤害。","maxrank":5,"cooldown":[8],"cost":[50,50,50,50,50],"image":{"full":"EzrealW.png","sprite":"spell3.png","group":"spell","x":336,"y":96,"w":48,"h":48},"cooldownBurn":"8","costBurn":"50/50/50/50/50","costType":"法力","rankValues":[{"label":"基础伤害","values":"80 / 135 / 190 / 245 / 300"}]},"icons":[{"file":"patch-notes/icons/36836d44a5f78790925eee035d934f80.webp","spellId":"EzrealW"}]},"R:精准弹幕":{"slot":"R","skill":{"id":"EzrealR","name":"精准弹幕","description":"伊泽瑞尔蓄力然后向目标区域释放长程能量波，对穿过的敌人造成高额伤害（对小兵和非史诗级野怪的伤害会减少）。","maxrank":3,"cooldown":[120,105,90],"cost":[100,100,100],"image":{"full":"EzrealR.png","sprite":"spell3.png","group":"spell","x":432,"y":96,"w":48,"h":48},"cooldownBurn":"120/105/90","costBurn":"100/100/100","costType":"法力","rankValues":[{"label":"基础伤害","values":"350 / 550 / 750"}]},"icons":[{"file":"patch-notes/icons/4778bd013edf8b9ade4b24687d534a68.webp","spellId":"EzrealR"}]}},"Gragas":{"W:醉酒狂暴":{"slot":"W","skill":{"id":"GragasW","name":"醉酒狂暴","description":"古拉加斯品尝他的最新佳酿，持续1秒。在喝完之后，他会变得喧闹且好斗，下次普通攻击会对附近的所有目标造成更多伤害，并且自身所受的伤害会降低。","maxrank":5,"cooldown":[5],"cost":[30,30,30,30,30],"image":{"full":"GragasW.png","sprite":"spell4.png","group":"spell","x":432,"y":48,"w":48,"h":48},"cooldownBurn":"5","costBurn":"30/30/30/30/30","costType":"法力","rankValues":[{"label":"基础伤害","values":"20 / 50 / 80 / 110 / 140"}]},"icons":[{"file":"patch-notes/icons/6ce365b3c4178a67c9fc89d7fd085af7.webp","spellId":"GragasW"}]}},"Kennen":{"W:奥义！电刃":{"slot":"W","skill":{"id":"KennenBringTheLight","name":"奥义！电刃","description":"凯南连续攻击附加额外伤害并对目标造成一层【忍法！雷缚印】，主动释放会对所有带有【忍法！雷缚印】的敌人造成闪电伤害，并额外附加一层【忍法！雷缚印】。","maxrank":5,"cooldown":[13,11.25,9.5,7.75,6],"cost":[40,40,40,40,40],"image":{"full":"KennenBringTheLight.png","sprite":"spell6.png","group":"spell","x":48,"y":144,"w":48,"h":48},"cooldownBurn":"13/11.25/9.5/7.75/6","costBurn":"40/40/40/40/40","costType":"能量","rankValues":[]}},"E:奥义！雷铠":{"slot":"E","skill":{"id":"KennenLightningRush","name":"奥义！雷铠","description":"凯南变身为一个闪电形态，高速移动并可以穿越单位。对碰到的所有敌人造成伤害并施加一层【忍法！雷缚印】。凯南会在进入这个形态时获得移动速度，并在离开时获得攻击速度。","maxrank":5,"cooldown":[10,9,8,7,6],"cost":[80,80,80,80,80],"image":{"full":"KennenLightningRush.png","sprite":"spell6.png","group":"spell","x":96,"y":144,"w":48,"h":48},"cooldownBurn":"10/9/8/7/6","costBurn":"80/80/80/80/80","costType":"能量","rankValues":[{"label":"基础伤害","values":"80 / 120 / 160 / 200 / 240"}]},"icons":[{"file":"patch-notes/icons/272c0ce3721f673cefcc280525fbf6db.webp","spellId":"KennenLightningRush"}]}},"TahmKench":{"E:厚实表皮":{"